{"id":"605072","name":"卤肉包","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/605072/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小麦面粉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"100g"},{"name":"85度热水","amount":"270g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"长茄子","amount":"3个"},{"name":"卤肉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主料都放入面包机中，按揉面程序揉面。","img":"images/605072/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茄子切细丁，加少许盐腌几分钟，再捏去水，沥干。加入调料，玉米油加热，倒入碗中中，拌匀茄子馅。放十分钟。","img":"images/605072/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"纯瘦卤肉切细丁，与茄子馅混合。","img":"images/605072/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"包子馅好了。","img":"images/605072/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面包机揉好的面醒15分钟。","img":"images/605072/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"揉成长条。","img":"images/605072/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切成剂子。","img":"images/605072/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成薄片。","img":"images/605072/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包成包子。","img":"images/605072/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中火蒸20分钟。关火焖三分钟。","img":"images/605072/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"比发酵的包子要硬，你喜欢吗？","img":"images/605072/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}